  "summary": "Index catalog inspection. _generic_list_indexes runs a dialect's ten-column catalog query and validates each row strictly into IndexInfo records (key and included columns, uniqueness, primary, validity, type, definition). Provides list-index SQL for sqlite, postgres, mysql, singlestore, mssql and oracle, and a DuckDB hook that combines duckdb_indexes() with index-backed constraints by parsing CREATE INDEX definitions with sqlglot.",
